in Sparta <note place="foot" n="4">zu &#x017F;chließen<lb/>
aus Plut. Lyk. 14.</note>, in Kreta <note place="foot" n="5">The&#x017F;. 19.</note>, in Olympia endlich Jung-<lb/>
